---
---

<section id="kontakt" class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <h1 id="cta-heading">Hei, jeg tar gjerne <em>en prat</em> om bedre arbeidshverdager hos dere.</h1>
  <p class="cta-sub">Send meg en melding så svarer jeg så snart jeg kan.</p>

  <div class="cta-columns">
    <form class="cta-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xykvdzba" method="POST">
      <div class="cta-field">
        <input type="text" name="navn" placeholder="Navnet ditt" autocomplete="name" required />
      </div>
      <div class="cta-field">
        <input type="email" name="epost" placeholder="E-post" autocomplete="email" required />
      </div>
      <div class="cta-field">
        <textarea name="melding" placeholder="Hva er situasjonen hos dere?" rows="3"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="cta-send">Send melding <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
    </form>

    <aside class="cta-sidebar">
      <div>
        <p class="cta-sidebar-label">Eller</p>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gardc/" class="cta-linkedin-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
          Finn meg på LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-referral">
        <p class="cta-sidebar-label">Tips noen</p>
        <p>Kjenner du noen som burde lese dette? <a href="#">Send dem en lenke.</a></p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--color-off-white);
  }

  .cta h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    max-width: 14ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .cta-sub {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(229, 225, 222, 0.55);
    max-width: 42ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .cta-columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* ── Form ── */
  .cta-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .cta-field input,
  .cta-field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(229, 225, 222, 0.3);
    color: var(--color-off-white);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    padding: 1.6rem 0 0.8rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-field input::placeholder,
  .cta-field textarea::placeholder {
    color: rgba(229, 225, 222, 0.55);
  }

  .cta-field input:focus,
  .cta-field textarea:focus {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-off-white);
  }

  .cta-field textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .cta-send {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(229, 225, 222, 0.3);
    color: var(--color-off-white);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .cta-send:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-off-white);
    background: rgba(229, 225, 222, 0.06);
  }

  /* ── Sidebar ── */
  .cta-sidebar {
    padding-top: 1.6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .cta-sidebar-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(229, 225, 222, 0.55);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .cta-linkedin-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-off-white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-linkedin-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .cta-linkedin-link svg {
    width: 1.1rem;
    height: 1.1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cta-referral p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: rgba(229, 225, 222, 0.55);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .cta-referral a {
    color: var(--color-off-white);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .cta-referral a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .cta-columns {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
